ONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q1102207ZL"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[1102207],"talks":[{"talkId":1102207,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["1102207","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_AUTO","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":1102207,"initDialog":110220701,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10232],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Zhongli1_11022/Q1102207","priority":0,"questId":11022,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":110220701,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"Wanyan","textMapHash":2549563122,"text":"This place seems familiar... Ah, I remember! I think there's some elemental monuments here — so you're saying they're related to all this?","nextNodeIds":[110220702]},{"nodeId":110220702,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"Wanyan","textMapHash":2468538506,"text":"When I investigated this seal last time, I had someone with a Vision accompany me.","nextNodeIds":[110220703]},{"nodeId":110220703,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"Wanyan","textMapHash":3964113098,"text":"But when we lit up all the elemental monuments, nothing happened...","nextNodeIds":[110220704]},{"nodeId":110220704,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2848683410,"text":"That's because you don't just need to activate them at the same time, but in a certain order as well. Otherwise, the seal will not be broken.","nextNodeIds":[110220705]},{"nodeId":110220705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":4150885986,"text":"The secret to this puzzle is hidden in the legends about the Archon War.","nextNodeIds":[110220706]},{"nodeId":110220706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":380163930,"text":"\"Tianheng in the <color=#00E1FFFF>south</color>, Yaoguang in the <color=#00E1FFFF>east</color>, Jueyun in the <color=#00E1FFFF>west</color>, Qingce in the <color=#00E1FFFF>north</color> — All desolate and devoid of life. Liyue is vast, yet even one haven is hard to find.\"","nextNodeIds":[110220707]},{"nodeId":110220707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"Kliment","textMapHash":2268090578,"text":"To the north... to the east... Do the people of Liyue always talk in riddles?","nextNodeIds":[110220708]},{"nodeId":110220708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"Wanyan","textMapHash":1909620218,"text":"I—I think I've heard this saying before!","nextNodeIds":[110220709]},{"nodeId":110220709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1089711114,"text":"Certainly you have, and the contents of this saying are also related to the God of Salt.","nextNodeIds":[110220710]},{"nodeId":110220710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2033409162,"text":"To provide a haven for her people, whose lives had been ravaged by the Archon War, this benevolent god searched all across Liyue.","nextNodeIds":[110220711]},{"nodeId":110220711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":3843207602,"text":"At that time, with the chaotic fires of war engulfing the land, even one sliver of peace was a luxury.","nextNodeIds":[110220712]},{"nodeId":110220712,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2461600146,"text":"And that haven she eventually found is right here. Today, it is known as Sal Terrae.","nextNodeIds":[110220713]},{"nodeId":110220713,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"Wanyan","textMapHash":3383008154,"text":"How sad then... In the end, this peaceful place was destroyed by Morax.","nextNodeIds":[110220714]},{"nodeId":110220714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"Kliment","textMapHash":596636546,"text":"Okay, enough with these ancient stories. Now that we have the clue, hurry up and break the seal! Whatever happened doesn't matter as long as we can get inside that ruin!","nextNodeIds":[110220715]},{"nodeId":110220715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":3559188458,"text":"#Now think, {NICKNAME}, <color=#00E1FFFF>\"Tianheng in the south, Yaoguang in the east, Jueyun in the west, Qingce in the north.\"</color>","nextNodeIds":[110220716]},{"nodeId":110220716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":513153442,"text":"With this clue, you should be able to solve the puzzle.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102207,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133002910,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q1102207ZL"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":1102209,"order":6,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":4118987028,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102209,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102209,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133102795"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REGI